# REF-01-U1.10 — Qwen2.5-0.5B full-model prefill logit receipt.
#
# Application-owned file adapter over the operator-local
# Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct-Q4_K_M.gguf artifact. The app resolves the path,
# admits the GGUF v3 table prefix through gradus:model/gguf_manifest,
# materializes stored-weight views through the bounded slice materializer,
# runs the U1.8 dense.forward graph, and prints the prefill-logit receipt
# (comparison policy, token ids, per-position top-1 / top-5, finite gate).
# Gradus never receives the path or a whole-model byte list.
#
# Compiled receipt tier: faber build --target rust, then execute the printed
# binary. The MIR stepper is not the receipt-tier engine.

